<title>USA: CSCE says spec limit for coffee to stay unchanged.</title>
<headline>CSCE says spec limit for coffee to stay unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange said Thursday its board of managers in a meeting Sept 11 voted not to accept a recommendation to reduce the speculative position limit on the Coffee &quot;C&quot; futures.</p>
<p>Wednesday, the exchange said its coffee committee recommended the board slash the speculative position limit on Coffee &quot;C&quot; futures from 500 to 200 lots during a contract's delivery period.</p>
<p>--Patricia Avidan, New York Commodity Desk 212-849-1640</p>
